  "term": "qualitative research",
  "definition": "Qualitative research is an approach that examines experiences and treatment effects through textual narratives rather than numerical data. It can be used on its own or alongside quantitative methods to provide a more complete understanding, such as exploring intervention impact or reasons people withdraw from or refuse treatment.",
